&lt;h2&gt;The Influencer Management Executive position is a liaison between KOLs / Influencers and the Account / clients team, facilitating social outreach and influencer marketing campaigns. Responsibilities include researching &amp;amp; proposing influencer lists, and managing project scopes and timelines to ensure successful execution. The role requires strong partnership management with KOLs and consistent communication with internal teams to track progress and knowledge of influencer marketing industry trend.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and engage social influencers to foster dialogue and promote client campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research &amp;amp; propose influencer lists for the campaigns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing quotations &amp;amp; optimizing KPI for client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Planning, Creative, and Creator Growth departments to develop plan &amp;amp; proposal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Briefing, negotiating &amp;amp; closing the deal with the Influencer to proceed with the campaign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing campaigns actively and closely to achieve good performance. Report after campaign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage influencers’ outcomes for all marketing campaigns and on all digital platforms (Facebook, YouTube, Instagram, Zalo, etc.), including coordinating with third parties and managing relationships between talents and the brand team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Finance/Legal team to prepare paperwork for influencers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new influencers &amp;amp; establish, and manage relationships with influencers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-manage at least 03 campaigns at the same time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the department as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 1 year of working experience as an Account, or KOLs/ Influencer management position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated understanding of digital media platforms &amp;amp; influencer market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter, a fast learner with a can-do spirit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client-service mindset&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-managed workload, negotiation skill, promptly given solutions to solve issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written English and Vietnamese communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open mind-set to utilize AI in daily tasks/operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Review (2 times per year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Bonus (1 time per year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TGIF, monthly birthday, and other fun events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MacBook to be provided&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good chance to explore new trends in the digital market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to learn and work with the most advanced advertising technology platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a professional, active, international and dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

